{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCEND. EXPLORE. SURVIVE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underkeep is a loving tribute to the role-playing classics of the 90s with turn-based combat and grid-based movement, bringing the best of old-school dungeon crawlers to the modern era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/08a889e89b5235918c4a38eee8bda0ba.poster.avif?t=1771973274\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/08a889e89b5235918c4a38eee8bda0ba.webm?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/08a889e89b5235918c4a38eee8bda0ba.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underkeep brings back the spirit of classic dungeon crawlers: grid movement, slow tension and tactical combat. At the same time it plays clean and responsive thanks to modern controls, clear visuals and thoughtful conveniences that remove the old frustrations without losing the heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/2bce66a6a768a5144d3489b4757fbf43.poster.avif?t=1771973274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/2bce66a6a768a5144d3489b4757fbf43.webm?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/2bce66a6a768a5144d3489b4757fbf43.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your party, venture into hand-built dungeons, speak with peculiar locals, discover hidden passages, solve ancient puzzles and face encounters where planning matters as much as courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGED PARTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick four adventurers whose strengths and flaws define how you survive. Synergy is everything: a good team deepens your strategy, a bad one seals your grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/99dba33440da7a2b716871b205eb5b74.avif?t=1771973274\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVING DUNGEONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor is handmade, every room hides intent. Expect strange rituals, lingering spirits, abandoned camps, cryptic symbols and choices that echo deeper than you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/0e0ea073dec6fb83fd60f285debaf427.poster.avif?t=1771973274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/0e0ea073dec6fb83fd60f285debaf427.webm?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/0e0ea073dec6fb83fd60f285debaf427.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based battles reward those who plan, control space and manage stamina &amp; mana wisely. The bold are rewarded. The careless are punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/c93a676b93a98e765b963983afe7cf78.poster.avif?t=1771973274\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/c93a676b93a98e765b963983afe7cf78.webm?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/c93a676b93a98e765b963983afe7cf78.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIDDEN SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden alcoves, fake walls, optional bosses and puzzles that fit the world instead of breaking immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/4f63f3675d30c29b911cd95152f18d2b.avif?t=1771973274\" width=440 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MODERN COMFORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth controls and clear feedback preserve the flow of exploration without sacrificing tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/777c9d47ddcb190743f29b998b201ed8.poster.avif?t=1771973274\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/777c9d47ddcb190743f29b998b201ed8.webm?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/777c9d47ddcb190743f29b998b201ed8.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERSONAL MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in automap with custom markers keeps track of mysteries, locked doors and places you swear you\u2019ll return to later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/97b196331bdad80ee7e9b26d1de40262.avif?t=1771973274\" width=600 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/19c78c57d607b634a48eadc6926f7e52.avif?t=1771973274\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every step is a story. Every descent a decision. Underkeep awaits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2411200?t=1771973274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2411200?t=1771973274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/be613d01113073810e847af70ea637777187ec02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771973274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/be613d01113073810e847af70ea637777187ec02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771973274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"descripti