ps/2411200/extras/2bce66a6a768a5144d3489b4757fbf43.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your party, venture into hand-built dungeons, speak with peculiar locals, discover hidden passages, solve ancient puzzles and face encounters where planning matters as much as courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGED PARTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick four adventurers whose strengths and flaws define how you survive. Synergy is everything: a good team deepens your strategy, a bad one seals your grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/99dba33440da7a2b716871b205eb5b74.avif?t=1771973274\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVING DUNGEONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor is handmade, every room hides intent. Expect strange rituals, lingering spirits, abandoned camps, cryptic symbols and choices that echo deeper than you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/0e0ea073dec6fb83fd60f285debaf427.poster.avif?t=1771973274\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/0e0ea073dec6fb83fd60f285debaf427.webm?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/0e0ea073dec6fb83fd60f285debaf427.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based battles reward those who plan, control space and manage stamina &amp; mana wisely. The bold are rewarded. The careless are punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/c93a676b93a98e765b963983afe7cf78.poster.avif?t=1771973274\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/c93a676b93a98e765b963983afe7cf78.webm?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/c93a676b93a98e765b963983afe7cf78.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIDDEN SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden alcoves, fake walls, optional bosses and puzzles that fit the world instead of breaking immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/4f63f3675d30c29b911cd95152f18d2b.avif?t=1771973274\" width=440 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MODERN COMFORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth controls and clear feedback preserve the flow of exploration without sacrificing tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/777c9d47ddcb190743f29b998b201ed8.poster.avif?t=1771973274\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/777c9d47ddcb190743f29b998b201ed8.webm?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/777c9d47ddcb190743f29b998b201ed8.mp4?t=1771973274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERSONAL MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in automap with custom markers keeps track of mysteries, locked doors and places you swear you\u2019ll return to later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/97b196331bdad80ee7e9b26d1de40262.avif?t=1771973274\" width=600 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/extras/19c78c57d607b634a48eadc6926f7e52.avif?t=1771973274\" width=620 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every step is a story. Every descent a decision. Underkeep awaits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Rake in Grass"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411200/bdb3f5587fca8d33e3d63572145f1ed7d656f8c0/header.jpg?t=1771973274","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2411200/1788832241/1e7fbc951649520d12243639befdf2d5771e58fe/1769252358/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769